.Dd February 21, 2026
.Dt devclass_get_sysctl 9
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm devclass_get_sysctl_ctx ,
.Nm devclass_get_sysctl_tree
.Nd Device class specific sysctl manipulation routines.
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In sys/param.h
.In sys/bus.h
.Ft "struct sysctl_ctx_list *"
.Fn devclass_get_sysctl_ctx "devclass_t dev"
.Ft "struct sysctl_oid *"
.Fn devclass_get_sysctl_tree "devclass_t dev"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Xr bus 9
automatically adds a
.Xr sysctl 9
node for each
.Xr devclass 9
in the system.
.Pp
The
.Xr devclass 9
node tree can be accessed with the
.Fn devclass_get_sysctl_tree
function.
.Pp
The context for the node can be obtained with the
.Fn devclass_get_sysctl_ctx
function.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
The
.Fn devclass_get_sysctl_ctx
and
.Fn devclass_get_sysctl_tree
functions will return a non
.Va NULL
value if the devclass's sysctls have been initialized.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr devclass 9 ,
.Xr device_get_sysctl_ctx 9 ,
.Xr device_get_sysctl_tree 9 ,
.Xr sysctl 9 ,
